    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "7762d1b9-6f73-4a26-bb61-fff131121190",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "74c42ce3-e052-4082-aba2-fc511024f3ec",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* central Liverpool hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome dinner\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tours at every gallery\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide Days 2 \u0026amp; 3\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "5baffdff-7cc0-40d7-812c-f91ed9ddd026",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights at the centrally located 4* Marriott Hotel in Liverpool. A welcome dinner is included in our hotel on the first evening and the remaining nights are on a bed and breakfast basis. Facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, and bar. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "6ca83d96-769e-4cb3-9182-f3e6f24487e9",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIntroductory tour of Liverpool\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELiverpool Anglican Cathedral\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMetropolitan Roman Catholic Cathedral\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWalker Art Gallery - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPort Sunlight Village\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELady Lever Art Gallery - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAntony Gormley\u2019s \u2018Another Place\u2019\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESpeke Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAlbert Dock\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Lowry, Salford - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "feb649cb-f811-48fb-a81b-4bfadf2a20ea",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESt George\u2019s Hall - described by the architectural historian Nikolaus Pevsner as one of the world\u2019s finest neo-Grecian buildings\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EQuarry Bank Mill \u0026amp; Styal Estate - the restored Georgian cotton mill tells the story of \u2018King Cotton\u2019 from a bale of raw cotton to finished cloth\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELittle Moreton Hall, Cheshire - regarded as the finest example of a timber framed moated house in the country\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPrinces Road Synagogue - described as \u2018the jewel in the crown\u2019 of Liverpool\u2019s rich and varied architecture, it was built in 1874 to the design of W\u0026amp;G Audsley and combines Gothic and Moorish elements with a sumptuous ark, pulpit and bimah\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERiver Mersey cruise - to see Liverpool from a different perspective\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETabley House, Knutsford - designed by John Carr of York for the Leicester family and widely regarded as the finest Palladian house in the North West, it boasts a fine collection of English paintings by artists such as Turner and Reynolds\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKnowsley Hall - the residence of the Earls of Derby and their predecessors since 1385\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "e6e7e363-34f2-4af5-af10-3a15d934ae7b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Liverpool\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at the designated pick up points \u2013 continue to the centrally located 4* Marriott Hotel in Liverpool \u2013 dinner in the hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Liverpool city tour, Liverpool cathedrals \u0026amp; Walker Art Gallery\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETour of Liverpool with our Blue Badge guide taking in the Metropolitan Roman Catholic Cathedral with its modern circular design and glorious multi coloured windows and the splendour of Liverpool Cathedral, one of the most iconic buildings of the city \u2013 guided tour of the Walker Art Gallery collection with works by Rembrandt, Poussin and Degas, 20th century works by artists such as Lucian Freud, David Hockney and Gilbert and George and one of the most important sculpture collections outside London.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Port Sunlight Village, Lady Lever Art Gallery \u0026amp; Antony Gormley\u2019s \u2018Another Place\u2019\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPort Sunlight Village was built by the Lever family for their workers and has over 900 listed and preserved buildings, wide streets and gardens \u2013 guided tour of British 18th and 19th century paintings, 18th century furniture and collections of Wedgwood and Chinese porcelain at the Lady Lever Art Gallery \u2013 Antony Gormley\u2019s \u2018Another Place\u2019 on Crosby Beach is a massive installation of 100 cast iron figures moulded from the artist\u2019s own body in the style that has become synonymous with his work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Speke Hall \u0026amp; Albert Dock\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpeke Hall is one of the country\u2019s most famous timbered houses whose Great Hall and priest hole date from Tudor times and with fine Jacobean plasterwork and intricately carved furniture \u2013 rest of the day at Liverpool\u2019s Albert Dock with free time to visit the International Slavery Museum, the Maritime Museum or the Beatles Museum, all housed within the Dock.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 The Lowry\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of The Lowry, an architectural flagship set in a magnificent waterside location at the heart of the redeveloped Salford Quays \u2013 return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
